<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" agent="tracera-diagram-gen" version="24.0.0" type="device"><diagram id="04-bug-to-fix-workflow" name="From bug report to reviewed fix"><mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="900" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1600" pageHeight="900" math="0" shadow="0" background="#FFFFFF"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="frame" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="1600" height="900" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="titlebar" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#FF6B35;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="26" width="56" height="5" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="title" value="&lt;b&gt;From bug report to reviewed fix&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;fontSize=26;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="36" width="1520" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="subtitle" value="One bug, end to end. Orange: a person decides. Grey: needs the Docker sandbox. White: code or a model working under rules." style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="74" width="1520" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s0" value="&lt;b&gt;1  Report the bug&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Web form, Chrome extension, MCP client or a confirmed meeting candidate. Screenshots, recordings, logs and stack traces attach as evidence." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFF1E9;strokeColor=#FF6B35;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="130" width="270" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s1" value="&lt;b&gt;2  Understand&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A model normalizes the report; user fields are never overwritten. Code clones the repository, searches it, reads history, maps stack frames and adds code-graph facts." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="352" y="130" width="270" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s2" value="&lt;b&gt;3  Prepare and reproduce&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Locked dependencies install behind the egress proxy. A model plans one reproduction, a test or browser steps, and the sandbox runs it before any patch." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#F6F1EC;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="664" y="130" width="270" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s3" value="&lt;b&gt;4  Hypotheses&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A model proposes causes with citations. Code checks every citation and sets each state by rule: possible, supported, contradicted, confirmed or ruled out." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="976" y="130" width="270" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s4" value="&lt;b&gt;5  Patch&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A model proposes edits. Code checks the patch policy, builds the diff (at most 200 lines in 5 files) and runs patch impact analysis on it." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1288" y="130" width="270" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t0" value="&lt;b&gt;6  Verify&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The sandbox applies the exact diff the reviewer sees, reruns the reproduction and the test suite. deriveVerificationOutcome sets the outcome." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#F6F1EC;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="370" width="270" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t1" value="&lt;b&gt;7  Report&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A fixed template writes the resolution report from stored data. Nothing is called verified unless the outcome says so." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="352" y="370" width="270" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t2" value="&lt;b&gt;8  Review&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A person approves, rejects or requests changes (back to step 5, limited attempts) and acknowledges every risk. Approval changes no files." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFF1E9;strokeColor=#FF6B35;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="664" y="370" width="270" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t3" value="&lt;b&gt;9  Authorize actions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Apply to the working tree, commit to a new branch, push without force: three separate requests from an owner session. Tokens and MCP can never make them." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFF1E9;strokeColor=#FF6B35;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="976" y="370" width="270" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="t4" value="&lt;b&gt;Run ends as&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;completed, awaiting approval, failed or cancelled. A failed run can be retried from the stage that failed." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#F6F1EC;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1288" y="370" width="270" height="180" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="rules_h" value="&lt;b&gt;Rules that hold at every step&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="580" width="600" height="28" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="k1" value="&lt;b&gt;Models never act&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;They return strict-schema JSON. Code validates it, checks every citation and sets each hypothesis state and each verification outcome." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="620" width="490" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="k2" value="&lt;b&gt;Nothing runs on the host&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Repository code, tests and browsers run only in the Docker sandbox. Without Docker (the hosted demo) steps 3 and 6 are recorded as blocked." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="555" y="620" width="490" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="k3" value="&lt;b&gt;Approval is not a change&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Approving records a decision. Apply, commit and push each need their own explicit request, and the user must echo the outcome they saw." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=14;spacingLeft=14;spacingRight=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1070" y="620" width="490" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_s0" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFF1E9;strokeColor=#FF6B35;strokeWidth=1.5;strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="862" width="34" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t0" value="A person decides" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="82" y="860" width="126" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_s1" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#F6F1EC;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="230" y="862" width="34" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t1" value="Needs the Docker sandbox" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="272" y="860" width="183" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_s2" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D342B;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D4C6B9;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="477" y="862" width="34" height="18" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t2" value="Code or model step" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="519" y="860" width="140" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_t3" value="Next step" style="text;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=13;fontColor=#7A6C5F;align=left;verticalAlign=top;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=2;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="727" y="860" width="75" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s0" target="s1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s1" target="s2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s2" target="s3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e4" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s3" target="s4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e5" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s4" target="t0"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1423" y="340"/><mxPoint x="175" y="340"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e6" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="t0" target="t1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e7" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="t1" target="t2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e8" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="t2" target="t3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e9" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;fontFamily=Helvetica;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#3D342B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#7A6C5F;strokeWidth=1.5;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="681" y="871" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="719" y="871" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
